WEBVTT

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:10.080
Thank you for coming. I'm Aran Elvarn.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:15.290
But first, I'd like to explain the situation to my father.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:20.750
Let's hear it.

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:25.750
It's the day before the arrest.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.130
Charlotte, my sister, disappeared from the bedroom of the mansion.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:31.860
It's the girl in the photo.

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:34.930
It's a four-wheeled black carriage.

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:38.040
Several people are watching it run to the north.

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.880
It's a noble carriage.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.530
Charlotte was kidnapped by a vampire.

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:47.160
I gathered about 20 search teams and chased them.

00:05:00.090 --> 00:05:05.240
It's a $500,000 deposit.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:10.440
If you bring your sister back, I'll pay you $10,000,000 in compensation.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.640
If you want to get it, go ahead.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.190
I hired hunters other than you.

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:17.260
I'll get ahead of you.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:19.260
It may be too late.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:22.160
It's about my daughter.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:24.350
What if she's already under the command of the nobility?

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:28.780
Save her before that!

00:05:29.280 --> 00:05:29.980
That's...

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:38.500
Calm down. Charlotte is an irreplaceable and precious daughter to me.

00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:44.020
She was a noble and noble woman who was kind to anyone.

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:52.120
Lend me your strength. And if you have to get a daughter, don't make me suffer.

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:55.670
Are you kidding me? Are you hiring her to kill Charlotte?

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:58.860
I'm not kidding. I'll give Dan Peele and his sister...

00:05:58.860 --> 00:05:59.800
You can do it.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:07.230
You know what? Killing that kid who turned into a vampire is very...

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:12.280
The reward is 20 million dollars. It's not worth more than that.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:12.540
You!

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:16.590
Don't you dare!

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:28.840
Let's make a promise. 20 million dollars.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.680
Save my daughter from the curse of fate.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:10.140
I didn't see a noble horse. It's a four-legged black horse.

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:13.890
Why are you hiding it?

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:46.460
I'm going to turn you into a vampire.

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:56.310
That's his job.

00:08:56.570 --> 00:08:59.420
You won't win.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.000
I'll let you live in peace.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.400
May the gods protect you.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:05.350
Leila...

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:06.640
Don't worry.

00:09:07.180 --> 00:09:08.600
I'll be born soon.

00:10:01.790 --> 00:10:05.520
Stop it. I won't let you get away.

00:10:10.680 --> 00:10:25.340
What? You still don't want to survive?

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:31.790
It's coming.

00:10:32.010 --> 00:10:44.000
Where is it?

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:15.190
Well done. Looks like you two have the same job.

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:18.650
And you sell the same prey, don't you?

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:22.100
My name is Volgoff. Volgoff Marcus.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.070
Let me hear your name.

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:25.090
D.

00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:32.960
I see, so that's who he is.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.470
The Hunter of Dunpeel.

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:35.940
As rumored.

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:37.900
Well, well, well.

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:39.660
You've had a good time, huh, bro?

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:40.280
It's no big deal if you're impressed by the business.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.120
That's right.

00:11:43.360 --> 00:11:45.640
If we weren't here, he might have been killed by them.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:50.880
I'll get rid of that and teach you all about it.

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:53.660
Hey, you guys.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:56.190
Do you know the story of the snake bird and the three-eyed fox?

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:58.880
What's that?

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:05.850
Three-eyed lice run around every morning and evening to collect food.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:09.340
But the snake bird can't stand three-eyed lice because the nest is full of food.

00:12:11.780 --> 00:12:15.010
So one day, a three-eyed lice thought,

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:20.650
I'll definitely be a snake bird when I'm born.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.310
That's good!

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:39.110
I'm not in a hurry, I'll just get my food ready.

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:44.100
What's wrong, Layla?

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:56.700
They're really bad, they're a bunch of idiots.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.480
We're going to have to kill them.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:12:59.980
I'll be back.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.000
It's better to get a job quickly.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:24.610
It's about 6 hours ago.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:27.330
While the sun is rising, he can't move.

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:29.120
I'll catch up immediately.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:33.120
Wait, what?

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:38.880
The pack is moving.

00:13:40.010 --> 00:13:55.220
What are you talking about?

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:59.250
I'll kill you.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:03.460
Hey!

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:07.770
Stop!

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:08.450
Hey!

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.320
You're a good-for-nothing!

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:11.840
I'm sorry!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:35.910
I'm not going to be able to live with you.

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:39.390
I'm not going to be able to live with you.

00:14:39.670 --> 00:14:54.980
You're so annoying.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.820
I'm going to be a pirate's shelter.

00:14:58.240 --> 00:14:59.980
I'm going to be a pirate's shelter.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:00.330
There are so many remains.

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:37.570
It's me.

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:37.850
Who?

00:15:40.610 --> 00:15:40.790
Who?

00:15:40.990 --> 00:15:42.620
A woman.

00:15:42.780 --> 00:15:44.220
Find the exit.

00:15:46.970 --> 00:15:47.370
Understood.

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:00.940
He ignores it

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:08.660
It's so weird

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:19.460
Oh my God, this is so weird

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:35.430
Can I kill?

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:00.960
We'll be right back.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:32.410
I stole it because I wanted it.

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.460
You should do the same.

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:37.540
If you can face the nobility at night...

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:50.320
Dampierre's hunter has an excellent man.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.900
You're Deacon.

00:17:54.620 --> 00:17:55.660
I wanted to see you once.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.420
I'm Maier Link.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:03.070
I'm a noble, too.

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.370
Human beings need fangs.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:35.680
He's already controlled by his body and mind, and he's left with nothing.

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:39.030
I knew it. It was too late.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:54.810
It won't last long like that.

00:18:54.890 --> 00:18:55.940
It's a shame.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.490
The blood of a young girl, hehehe

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:05.500
The scent of that blood is unbearable, isn't it?

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:16.350
But, can you heal my throat?

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:41.380
What are you trying to do?

00:19:41.640 --> 00:19:46.570
I've taken out the fragments that I've eaten into my body and sterilized them. That's all.

00:19:46.790 --> 00:19:51.920
You didn't even ask me to do it, but you really touched my body.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.790
What are you trying to do?

00:19:54.810 --> 00:19:58.200
If you get a fever, I'll pull you back.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:19:59.520
Don't bother me.

00:20:01.310 --> 00:20:03.890
The hunter will not go to the daughter who calls her mother's name after her death.

00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:20.930
I should have left it alone.

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:23.630
It's getting more and more troublesome.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.320
Is it really this way?

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:39.940
There is one thing that a noble who was chased by a tough hunter must do.

00:21:40.220 --> 00:21:41.800
There is no doubt about it.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:43.020
Barbaroi, huh?

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.390
It's what my brother said.

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:47.330
But I don't want to deal with only the people there.

00:21:48.790 --> 00:21:58.540
It hurts, Veila. It hurts.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:21:59.670
You're hurt.

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:05.230
It's okay, Brother Glove. You must be tired after a long trip.

00:22:05.790 --> 00:22:08.630
I hope you can sleep for a while.

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:12.880
You didn't heal that wound yourself, did you?

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:18.320
You're a strange Dampir.

00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:23.080
But for us, you're just another annoying being.

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:25.400
Of course.

00:22:42.760 --> 00:22:43.340
Why is it stopped?

00:22:43.940 --> 00:22:46.540
Well, let's see how it goes.

00:22:46.820 --> 00:22:49.970
Lena, wait for the globe until you figure out what's going on.

00:22:50.210 --> 00:22:51.280
Got it.

00:24:00.440 --> 00:24:00.960
You're messing with me.

00:24:01.180 --> 00:24:02.760
Don't let your guard down.

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:16.140
I didn't know you could step on my feet this far.

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:17.340
You're like a bug that kills itself.

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:19.810
I'll give it a try.

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:23.860
For 5,000 years, I've been mixing the blood and blood of the demons.

00:24:24.240 --> 00:24:26.720
Like Valparaiso in the dark.

00:24:26.940 --> 00:24:29.370
Your arms are strong.

00:24:30.190 --> 00:24:31.290
God bless you.

00:25:03.230 --> 00:25:04.010
Be careful.

00:25:05.140 --> 00:25:07.680
What do you mean by shadows?

00:25:10.330 --> 00:25:11.030
What? Naruto?

00:25:11.580 --> 00:25:22.130
What the hell is that?

00:25:22.350 --> 00:25:25.490
It's coming out!

00:25:25.530 --> 00:25:26.220
Don't be stupid!

00:25:26.720 --> 00:25:27.750
Give me an answer!

00:25:28.090 --> 00:25:28.930
It's coming out!

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.180
I've been hurt this much!

00:25:31.260 --> 00:25:33.210
I can't stand it anymore!

00:25:33.610 --> 00:25:34.600
This...

00:25:34.600 --> 00:25:35.680
This is ridiculous!

00:25:36.680 --> 00:25:38.680
What the hell!

00:25:49.040 --> 00:25:51.860
Are you going to get into Barbaroy's village from the front?

00:25:53.240 --> 00:25:54.270
I don't think so.

00:25:55.010 --> 00:25:58.430
Is your head just to put on a hat?

00:26:00.160 --> 00:26:00.620
Use your brain!

00:26:01.120 --> 00:26:04.200
Can't you say something?

00:26:04.680 --> 00:26:19.350
I'm Hunter D.

00:26:19.470 --> 00:26:20.750
I'm here for a business.

00:26:21.350 --> 00:26:22.720
I'd like to ask you to buy something.

00:26:52.460 --> 00:26:54.100
You look like a good boy, Ichirika.

00:27:07.680 --> 00:27:09.470
Oh, so you came down from the hill.

00:27:09.750 --> 00:27:12.680
I'm here to pay my respects to the elderly.

00:27:12.860 --> 00:27:17.840
Please give me the girl in that carriage.

00:27:19.740 --> 00:27:25.610
She's a brave and beautiful young lady.

00:27:25.890 --> 00:27:29.710
I'd like to say that she's a good friend, but we're...

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:32.140
I've already received a request from the monkey lord to guard that nobleman.

00:27:33.680 --> 00:27:36.020
That too is one million dollars worth of gold.

00:27:36.820 --> 00:27:38.300
Can I pay you that much?

00:27:39.060 --> 00:27:42.080
If I pay you, will you betray that client?

00:27:42.940 --> 00:27:44.500
Hehehehe.

00:27:44.500 --> 00:27:45.660
It's a pleasure, a pleasure.

00:27:45.760 --> 00:27:46.840
It's really a pleasure.

00:27:47.440 --> 00:27:53.180
We, the villagers of Barbaroi, have been fed by that vampire king for thousands of years.

00:27:53.740 --> 00:27:55.120
You also know that we have become the shadow of the nobleman.

00:27:57.740 --> 00:27:59.620
And towards us...

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:01.540
How could you say such a thing?

00:28:02.380 --> 00:28:07.570
I've seen a lot of Lampires, but this is the first time I've seen a guy like you.

00:28:07.830 --> 00:28:11.160
It's a shame to die. It's really a shame.

00:28:11.690 --> 00:28:14.210
But I'm not going to let you go back from here.

00:28:15.280 --> 00:28:16.420
I'll take your life.

00:28:18.330 --> 00:28:22.340
Everyone here has a unique skill.

00:28:23.940 --> 00:28:27.200
Even though he's an excellent hunter, it's impossible to defeat everyone.

00:28:38.120 --> 00:28:38.340
You're an idiot.

00:28:38.800 --> 00:28:40.530
I'm going to beat you up.

00:28:40.610 --> 00:28:43.790
Hey, you're not done yet.

00:28:43.870 --> 00:28:46.820
I'm sorry.

00:28:47.160 --> 00:28:50.380
If I have to borrow your power,

00:28:51.100 --> 00:28:53.060
I'll take the revenge of Nolto.

00:28:55.340 --> 00:28:56.480
I know, brother.

00:28:57.040 --> 00:28:58.710
I'm counting on you.

00:29:00.190 --> 00:29:02.500
Don't push yourself too hard and come back for sure, okay?

00:29:03.140 --> 00:29:12.430
If you kill me, a few villagers will be injured.

00:29:12.940 --> 00:29:15.180
That can't be helped.

00:29:16.350 --> 00:29:18.470
However, the name of Barbaroy will leave a dirty scar.

00:29:19.640 --> 00:29:25.540
I'll eliminate all the villagers and be your opponent if that's okay.

00:29:25.900 --> 00:29:29.310
Oh, I see. Good.

00:29:30.000 --> 00:29:33.120
I'm sure it'll be even more fun if you follow me.

00:29:33.120 --> 00:29:36.790
Master Choro, that's exactly what he said.

00:29:37.910 --> 00:29:41.970
You can leave this to the three of us who are on guard.

00:29:42.210 --> 00:29:47.400
If you're going to get on with it from the beginning, I'll be on your side.

00:29:48.410 --> 00:29:50.150
No way.

00:29:50.630 --> 00:29:52.760
There's nothing wrong with us shadow people.

00:29:54.060 --> 00:29:56.500
We just have to do our job.

00:29:56.500 --> 00:29:58.720
Only this will change our minds.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:00.640
What the hell are you doing?

00:30:33.740 --> 00:30:33.900
you

00:31:34.090 --> 00:31:37.100
Hunter D, he's a great guy.

00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:39.320
But if you're the three of the Barbaroids,

00:31:39.860 --> 00:31:41.940
you'll have to win.

00:31:42.460 --> 00:31:43.600
It's good, huh?

00:32:25.720 --> 00:32:26.400
No, it's just us.

00:32:42.220 --> 00:32:42.440
Thank you.

00:32:44.250 --> 00:32:54.880
Where did that woman go?

00:32:55.360 --> 00:32:56.420
Didn't you get caught up in a car accident?

00:32:57.740 --> 00:32:59.160
That's not what I mean.

00:33:35.150 --> 00:33:36.550
It's as rough as ever.

00:33:37.070 --> 00:33:39.380
Let's just enjoy it a little more.

00:33:39.540 --> 00:33:41.380
Then you do the cleaning later.

00:33:41.980 --> 00:33:44.700
Thank you, Ms. Carolil.

00:33:45.160 --> 00:33:48.750
That's right, you monster.

00:33:49.170 --> 00:33:51.070
Everyone, are you okay?

00:33:51.290 --> 00:33:53.630
Brother Frog was thrown out.

00:33:53.850 --> 00:33:59.320
Where is Frog?

00:34:03.100 --> 00:34:03.600
He's still nearby.

00:34:04.180 --> 00:34:18.000
He's completely dead.

00:34:18.830 --> 00:34:20.190
Get out of here!

00:34:20.470 --> 00:34:21.750
I know you're in there.

00:34:22.450 --> 00:34:23.960
I can smell your stinky teeth.

00:34:25.420 --> 00:34:28.370
I'll kill you right away, so pray for me!

00:34:35.470 --> 00:34:37.310
I'm going to die, Mizomi-kun.

00:34:43.420 --> 00:34:44.900
I'm not a bad guy.

00:35:03.960 --> 00:35:05.840
What should I do? Should I clean up the mess?

00:35:05.960 --> 00:35:15.630
Be careful in the shadows.

00:35:15.950 --> 00:35:17.130
I see.

00:35:17.570 --> 00:35:21.400
Kyle, don't take another step.

00:35:21.980 --> 00:35:23.130
Don't say that.

00:35:23.250 --> 00:35:25.010
That's what I don't like the most.

00:35:25.170 --> 00:35:25.530
I don't want to die.

00:35:27.130 --> 00:35:28.130
What did you say?

00:36:07.360 --> 00:36:09.950
This is no good. I can't run anymore.

00:36:10.330 --> 00:36:11.980
What should I do?

00:36:12.910 --> 00:36:14.970
Hey, bro, are you listening?

00:36:17.440 --> 00:36:20.060
What do you think of the globes?

00:36:20.520 --> 00:36:21.460
It's not very good.

00:36:22.530 --> 00:36:24.010
What's wrong, Brother Volkov?

00:36:24.470 --> 00:36:28.240
Yeah, I'm thinking about something.

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:32.040
I wonder how far the tanker is trying to escape.

00:36:32.840 --> 00:36:37.050
Maybe it's going to the port of Evral and cross the sea on a ship.

00:36:37.150 --> 00:36:38.300
Or maybe it's going to dive deep into the mountains of Granars.

00:36:40.800 --> 00:36:41.790
I don't know.

00:36:44.420 --> 00:36:46.300
Anyway, it's a matter of fuel supply.

00:36:46.620 --> 00:36:49.120
If it's the town of Galusha, it's far away.

00:36:49.480 --> 00:36:51.060
Kairu, go with Ray.

00:36:51.520 --> 00:36:52.880
I'll take care of the car body.

00:37:35.790 --> 00:37:40.100
D, why don't you take a break?

00:37:40.360 --> 00:37:44.260
Even if you say you're different from other Danpeers, I'll answer you this time.

00:37:45.300 --> 00:37:50.820
Listen to me sometimes.

00:37:51.420 --> 00:37:57.750
I know you're good at fighting, but I'm not good enough for you.

00:38:11.740 --> 00:38:12.860
Okay, how much is it?

00:38:13.040 --> 00:38:14.080
I-I'm fine.

00:38:14.580 --> 00:38:15.520
Don't refuse.

00:38:16.100 --> 00:38:16.500
Here.

00:38:17.010 --> 00:38:17.820
Th-thank you.

00:38:18.020 --> 00:38:18.970
Let's go.

00:38:19.270 --> 00:38:19.610
Hm?

00:38:21.470 --> 00:38:27.720
That Dampir guy.

00:38:29.360 --> 00:38:29.900
Kaeru-niisan.

00:38:30.280 --> 00:38:33.460
Go back first. I have a good idea.

00:38:33.880 --> 00:38:38.180
What is it?

00:38:38.260 --> 00:38:41.330
If you look closely, you look like a woman.

00:38:42.910 --> 00:38:44.520
So what?

00:38:44.920 --> 00:38:47.500
Be careful not to get caught by Dampierre.

00:39:04.320 --> 00:39:04.840
I won't give you the cold beer.

00:39:05.260 --> 00:39:20.240
You have quite a lot of stuff.

00:39:20.980 --> 00:39:23.980
It's okay. I won't bother you.

00:39:24.680 --> 00:39:28.670
That's fine, but let me take care of the stuff on your waist.

00:39:33.680 --> 00:39:48.020
You heard that, right? She's a good girl.

00:39:48.220 --> 00:39:52.310
I'll treat you to a drink. But you're busy, aren't you?

00:39:52.370 --> 00:39:54.010
Hm. Well, yeah.

00:39:54.600 --> 00:39:57.430
That's right. You don't have time to worry about me, do you?

00:39:57.650 --> 00:39:59.750
Someone more ugly is running this town.

00:40:00.520 --> 00:40:02.540
What is it?

00:40:02.880 --> 00:40:10.940
I want to buy that horse.

00:40:11.520 --> 00:40:15.140
It's 300,000 dollars.

00:40:15.620 --> 00:40:18.110
If you think it's expensive, you can look for it elsewhere.

00:40:38.510 --> 00:40:38.750
Don't move!

00:40:38.850 --> 00:40:40.260
What do you want from this town?

00:40:40.960 --> 00:40:42.880
I don't know.

00:40:43.160 --> 00:40:45.360
I paid for it.

00:40:45.700 --> 00:40:53.980
It's a real $20,000 gold coin.

00:40:56.370 --> 00:40:58.240
I'm sorry, but there's no such thing in this town.

00:41:01.180 --> 00:41:02.720
Horses are one of the most foolish ironworks.

00:41:02.820 --> 00:41:05.840
Pick up the money and get out of here.

00:41:06.770 --> 00:41:07.130
Understood?

00:41:08.520 --> 00:41:10.060
Hey, hey, don't get in the way of business.

00:41:10.740 --> 00:41:11.800
That horse is mine.

00:41:12.380 --> 00:41:13.660
I don't care who sells it.

00:41:14.360 --> 00:41:17.420
Old man Polk, I can't let you do whatever you want.

00:41:17.900 --> 00:41:19.510
Are you trying to disrupt the discipline of this town?

00:41:20.110 --> 00:41:21.170
Discipline?

00:41:21.350 --> 00:41:22.410
That's right.

00:41:22.510 --> 00:41:24.880
I won't allow no nobles or nobles to enter this town.

00:41:24.940 --> 00:41:26.680
I see. Discipline.

00:41:26.880 --> 00:41:29.200
It's true that there were nobles around here in the past.

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:32.210
There were a lot of people. And there were a lot of victims.

00:41:33.610 --> 00:41:35.310
Now, pick up the money.

00:41:36.310 --> 00:41:39.210
It's a long time before that Christian thing was done.

00:41:39.450 --> 00:41:41.250
Do you know this story?

00:41:41.950 --> 00:41:44.830
In this town, a young child...

00:41:45.000 --> 00:41:47.180
more than 10 people were kidnapped altogether.

00:41:47.880 --> 00:41:49.510
What happened?

00:41:50.250 --> 00:41:52.650
The enemy is a terrible noble.

00:41:52.930 --> 00:41:54.920
The people of the town finally decided

00:41:54.920 --> 00:41:58.380
to make money together and hire a vampire hunter.

00:42:01.080 --> 00:42:03.960
The hunter came. He was a very strong man.

00:42:04.320 --> 00:42:08.980
He defeated a large number of nobles and saved the young children.

00:42:10.490 --> 00:42:15.410
But the people of the town chased the hunter out of the town without saying a word.

00:42:15.470 --> 00:42:25.210
The hunter was Dampierre, so people were afraid to have half of the nobles' blood, so they threw stones at those who should say thanks and chased them out.

00:42:25.830 --> 00:42:26.870
So what are you talking about?

00:42:27.290 --> 00:42:29.060
Well, just...

00:42:29.240 --> 00:42:29.900
This town's

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:32.640
I'll protect the discipline. Don't talk nonsense.

00:42:33.120 --> 00:42:39.850
But, Dampierre didn't take the blood of the nobility because he liked it.

00:42:40.790 --> 00:42:43.020
What are you doing?

00:42:45.000 --> 00:42:45.240
You're right.

00:42:46.860 --> 00:42:48.600
Do you know what you're doing?

00:42:49.420 --> 00:42:49.900
Probably.

00:42:50.840 --> 00:42:52.200
Don't be stupid.

00:42:52.680 --> 00:42:53.910
I won't forgive you.

00:42:53.950 --> 00:42:54.190
You're a fool.

00:42:54.760 --> 00:42:57.110
You think I don't care if you're a fool?

00:42:58.350 --> 00:42:59.390
I don't care.

00:43:02.780 --> 00:43:03.480
N-No.

00:43:03.720 --> 00:43:06.540
Then I won't get in your way.

00:43:07.560 --> 00:43:10.880
Bring the horse.

00:43:11.700 --> 00:43:13.180
Reio.

00:43:13.970 --> 00:43:15.500
Nah, I'm not talking about Reio.

00:43:16.480 --> 00:43:24.370
I'm talking about the kids you saved from the Mano clan decades ago.

00:43:25.130 --> 00:43:27.440
I was one of them.

00:43:31.820 --> 00:43:35.920
Even now, the way you looked at that time is clearly engraved in my eyes.

00:43:37.290 --> 00:43:45.100
That hat of Tsubahiro, the pendant on your chest, the long sword on your back, and that beautiful face.

00:43:45.380 --> 00:43:46.950
It's the same as it was at that time.

00:43:47.190 --> 00:43:50.300
After all, Dampierre doesn't get old.

00:43:50.660 --> 00:43:54.300
Hurry up and go. My arms are numb and I'm scared.

00:44:15.900 --> 00:44:17.220
He's too slow.

00:44:17.400 --> 00:44:19.830
I'm tired of horse riding.

00:44:20.010 --> 00:44:22.480
I'll get ready and move on.

00:44:22.560 --> 00:44:29.620
What do you think, Maierling?

00:44:32.560 --> 00:44:33.180
Now is the time to die!

00:44:33.640 --> 00:44:39.680
Let me be alone for a while.

00:44:39.700 --> 00:44:43.200
This is the last time to enjoy the light of the fire.

00:44:44.020 --> 00:44:45.820
Die for me.

00:45:02.620 --> 00:45:04.160
Thank you.

00:45:35.370 --> 00:45:37.690
Those who have been ordained by the nobility will not walk in this sunlight.

00:45:38.890 --> 00:45:42.380
But you shouted the name of the nobility at that time.

00:45:42.580 --> 00:45:47.060
Tell me why.

00:45:47.700 --> 00:45:54.330
I didn't say anything to you.

00:46:00.830 --> 00:46:01.450
I love Maier Link.

00:46:03.450 --> 00:46:08.380
Please believe me. You should understand.

00:46:08.960 --> 00:46:10.780
You don't understand.

00:46:11.240 --> 00:46:14.050
An aristocrat is an aristocrat.

00:46:14.090 --> 00:46:16.310
Soon you will be his companion.

00:46:16.930 --> 00:46:19.230
If that happens, I won't let you live.

00:46:20.530 --> 00:46:21.230
I don't care.

00:46:21.590 --> 00:46:24.300
Charlotte of the Elburn family is no longer in this world.

00:46:25.520 --> 00:46:26.520
If you want to bring me back,

00:46:27.060 --> 00:46:28.080
please kill me here now.

00:46:33.040 --> 00:46:33.440
Loving the nobles?

00:46:34.240 --> 00:46:37.000
Yes, that's right.

00:46:37.180 --> 00:46:42.220
Stupid girl.

00:46:42.460 --> 00:46:43.300
Hurry up and come.

00:46:43.540 --> 00:46:44.530
I'm not going back!

00:46:46.090 --> 00:46:46.770
Don't mess with me.

00:46:47.130 --> 00:46:48.110
Because of that noble.

00:46:48.650 --> 00:46:50.400
What happened to all the villagers who have nothing to do with it?

00:46:51.360 --> 00:46:52.250
Do you know?

00:46:52.630 --> 00:46:58.290
If you get close, I won't forgive you.

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:02.400
This is what happens when you mess with the clock.

00:47:02.700 --> 00:47:04.910
You're the one who doesn't want to work as a hunter.

00:48:00.030 --> 00:48:00.310
It's too late.

00:48:02.170 --> 00:48:16.720
We need to get out of here as soon as possible.

00:49:01.820 --> 00:49:01.840
You

00:49:35.240 --> 00:49:42.000
It's me.

00:49:43.480 --> 00:49:46.360
The prey is heading north from Chiffon Lake.

00:49:46.460 --> 00:49:55.870
Well, I don't see it though.

00:50:12.800 --> 00:50:13.380
I regretted it.

00:50:47.720 --> 00:50:48.380
Even if I die, it's futile.

00:50:48.520 --> 00:50:51.430
D'Amphibie, go to hell first!

00:51:46.640 --> 00:51:49.830
Don't get me wrong. I just returned what I owed you yesterday.

00:51:50.130 --> 00:51:52.150
The nobles are like animals.

00:51:52.650 --> 00:51:53.620
You're just like them.

00:51:53.880 --> 00:51:56.540
I don't want to get too close, but I can't help it for a while.

00:52:03.770 --> 00:52:08.820
It's because your mother sacrificed herself to take revenge on the nobility.

00:52:08.820 --> 00:52:12.160
It has nothing to do with you.

00:52:12.180 --> 00:52:14.840
What are you going to do after hearing that?

00:52:14.920 --> 00:52:22.180
You really have changed, even though you're a Danpeer.

00:52:22.540 --> 00:52:28.450
When my mother was kidnapped, I should have hired a hunter like you.

00:52:31.020 --> 00:52:32.580
But it didn't go that way.

00:52:32.580 --> 00:52:35.600
My father was killed by the nobles.

00:52:35.600 --> 00:52:38.280
About a month later, my mother returned to the village.

00:52:38.340 --> 00:52:43.180
She was captured by the villagers.

00:52:43.240 --> 00:52:44.340
She was killed by a heart attack.

00:52:44.800 --> 00:52:46.880
In front of me.

00:52:47.380 --> 00:52:49.040
Screaming in horror.

00:52:49.080 --> 00:52:51.650
I left the village to avenge.

00:52:52.370 --> 00:52:55.320
Eventually, I met Marcus's brother and became friends.

00:52:55.960 --> 00:52:58.250
And I met a lot of nobles.

00:52:58.730 --> 00:52:59.970
And then...

00:53:00.510 --> 00:53:02.510
I've seen how much they did a terrible thing to humans.

00:53:02.550 --> 00:53:06.020
It's a good reason to take revenge.

00:53:07.900 --> 00:53:10.720
It's fun to hunt animals.

00:53:11.240 --> 00:53:13.230
Even a woman is a human.

00:53:15.750 --> 00:53:17.030
This hatred will never disappear.

00:53:17.330 --> 00:53:19.080
Even if you die, you'll think so in the grave.

00:53:20.160 --> 00:53:21.620
If you think that's pathetic,

00:53:22.120 --> 00:53:24.650
You can put a flower in my grave.

00:53:25.590 --> 00:53:28.100
You seem to like unnecessary answers.

00:53:30.800 --> 00:53:32.910
That's right. Don't you promise?

00:53:33.370 --> 00:53:36.340
If you're alive, you'll do it for me.

00:53:36.400 --> 00:53:40.450
Instead, when you die, I'll do it for you.

00:53:40.450 --> 00:53:41.900
Isn't that good?

00:53:42.000 --> 00:53:46.610
Even if there's someone who does that for me, it's useless.

00:53:47.600 --> 00:53:48.850
I don't care.

00:53:49.230 --> 00:53:50.490
Let's make a promise.

00:53:50.790 --> 00:53:56.230
If there's a grave for someone who died as a hunter...

00:53:56.600 --> 00:53:56.960
Stop it.

00:53:57.120 --> 00:53:57.850
It's a joke.

00:53:58.270 --> 00:53:59.940
More than that...

00:54:00.480 --> 00:54:01.620
Why do you keep hunting?

00:54:42.960 --> 00:54:45.200
The rain didn't make them go that far, did it?

00:54:45.760 --> 00:54:49.520
From now on, we're not going anywhere.

00:54:49.800 --> 00:54:58.630
Aniki...

00:55:00.410 --> 00:55:01.470
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:55:01.810 --> 00:55:04.760
Their destination...

00:55:04.760 --> 00:55:06.140
Could it be...

00:55:06.320 --> 00:55:07.620
That could be it.

00:55:07.920 --> 00:55:11.470
If they run away there, no one will be able to catch up with them.

00:55:12.010 --> 00:55:13.790
Huh? The legendary castle?

00:55:14.360 --> 00:55:14.900
Is it really there?

00:55:15.280 --> 00:55:16.280
I'm not kidding!

00:55:16.900 --> 00:55:18.440
I'm sorry for getting close to that place!

00:55:19.040 --> 00:55:19.920
It's too dangerous!

00:55:20.400 --> 00:55:23.320
Heh, even if it's just a little bit, it's not a big deal.

00:55:23.600 --> 00:55:24.020
Don't make such a pitiful voice.

00:55:24.200 --> 00:55:26.580
We just need to put a shield on before they run away.

00:55:26.920 --> 00:55:29.880
I'm sure there's a big bridge ahead.

00:55:31.560 --> 00:55:32.280
Let's use that.

00:55:32.940 --> 00:55:36.180
So it's the way to kill 10 nobles in Keld.

00:55:36.360 --> 00:55:39.400
Yeah, this is our last chance.

00:55:39.760 --> 00:55:41.900
Leila, can you hear me?

00:55:42.100 --> 00:55:43.650
Yes, I can.

00:55:44.390 --> 00:55:44.750
Where are you now?

00:55:45.490 --> 00:55:46.600
I'm a little late.

00:55:46.960 --> 00:55:49.240
Let's settle this quickly.

00:55:49.770 --> 00:55:50.130
Come on.

00:56:20.320 --> 00:56:24.620
Don't move. If you do that again, we'll all be blown away.

00:56:24.620 --> 00:56:27.340
Wanna give it a try?

00:56:31.820 --> 00:56:32.820
Alright, I'm going home.

00:56:32.980 --> 00:56:37.820
I'm going to get in your way.

00:56:38.320 --> 00:56:38.560
Hah!

00:56:42.500 --> 00:56:45.340
Oh, well. You're still human, huh?

00:56:45.480 --> 00:56:48.390
I'll help you, so don't worry about it.

00:56:49.370 --> 00:56:54.740
Michelle, come on!

00:56:55.660 --> 00:56:56.080
Hey!

00:56:56.960 --> 00:56:58.270
Don't do that!

00:56:58.960 --> 00:56:59.400
Hurry up!

00:57:00.410 --> 00:57:01.370
Hurry up, you bastard!

00:57:10.860 --> 00:57:13.770
Heh, Barbaroi's monster is no big deal.

00:57:15.360 --> 00:57:15.860
Big brother!

00:57:16.080 --> 00:57:16.220
Hm?

00:57:17.690 --> 00:57:17.770
Hm?

00:57:30.030 --> 00:57:32.390
Who do you think you are, to think that a noble man would come out to the countryside?

00:57:33.790 --> 00:57:36.980
What the hell are you talking about?

00:57:38.890 --> 00:57:45.410
It's a good idea.

00:57:45.750 --> 00:57:47.060
Try to take it back before it's all burned down.

00:58:03.260 --> 00:58:05.010
Hey, what's wrong?

00:58:05.030 --> 00:58:07.190
Oh, just a little more.

00:58:08.070 --> 00:58:10.370
Hey, what's wrong?

00:58:10.530 --> 00:58:13.630
You want this kid's blood, don't you?

00:58:13.670 --> 00:58:15.020
Why don't you just die?

00:58:15.380 --> 00:58:16.040
What's wrong?

00:58:16.060 --> 00:58:16.680
What's wrong?

00:58:23.480 --> 00:58:24.400
Idiot!

00:59:10.400 --> 00:59:11.960
Big brother, I'm going to sink.

00:59:12.580 --> 00:59:15.040
Leave the girl alone and let's do it quickly.

00:59:15.180 --> 00:59:16.320
Do you have the strength?

00:59:16.980 --> 00:59:18.740
All right, I'll do it.

00:59:22.660 --> 00:59:22.740
Go!

01:00:06.490 --> 01:00:06.850
Don't worry.

01:00:07.330 --> 01:00:11.380
The scars of this ceremony will heal soon.

01:00:11.420 --> 01:00:16.850
I will definitely reach it with you.

01:00:17.030 --> 01:00:21.570
Go to the capital of the night at the end of the starry sky.

01:00:23.100 --> 01:00:25.980
Don't fight with humans.

01:00:26.560 --> 01:00:29.680
Believe in me.

01:01:15.100 --> 01:01:16.830
Let's give up this job.

01:01:16.830 --> 01:01:23.130
If we go to the castle of Cheite, no one will be able to go home.

01:01:23.450 --> 01:01:29.010
How about those dead who retreated as they were?

01:01:31.020 --> 01:01:32.910
But...

01:01:32.910 --> 01:01:34.830
Shut up! You're not allowed to cry!

01:01:35.010 --> 01:01:39.210
Hey, Ira.

01:01:39.330 --> 01:01:42.900
Brother Glove.

01:01:43.280 --> 01:01:48.270
You know why the nobles are shaking just by hearing our names, right?

01:01:49.680 --> 01:01:53.840
The Marcus brothers will definitely kill the prey they're after.

01:01:54.560 --> 01:01:57.080
That won't change from now on.

01:01:57.240 --> 01:01:58.930
I don't feel like going back.

01:02:00.410 --> 01:02:03.330
That's right. Don't say a word about it again.

01:02:03.670 --> 01:02:05.930
I won't let them get away with it.

01:02:07.430 --> 01:02:18.830
It's the Vael Link.

01:02:20.200 --> 01:02:20.520
I know.

01:02:22.220 --> 01:02:23.120
There's only a little time left until the castle.

01:02:24.080 --> 01:02:25.700
I'm going to settle things with them here.

01:02:25.880 --> 01:02:26.260
Sorry.

01:02:51.020 --> 01:02:52.640
The castle of legend, Chetika.

01:02:54.520 --> 01:02:59.740
More than 5,000 years ago, the vampire king and his family...

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:02.720
It was the home of Carmilla Bartley, who built the era of the movie.

01:03:05.130 --> 01:03:09.490
Carmilla was called the White Lady of the Dragon's Blood to keep her beauty and beauty.

01:03:09.810 --> 01:03:11.950
She gave birth to a lot of human blood.

01:03:12.730 --> 01:03:15.760
Her cruel act touched the anger of the Popeye King.

01:03:16.640 --> 01:03:18.020
She was killed with her own hands.

01:03:18.640 --> 01:03:23.740
Since then, she has lost her courage and has not even come close to the nobility.

01:03:24.040 --> 01:03:27.430
I have a bad feeling about this.

01:03:27.810 --> 01:03:28.870
Well, let's get started.

01:03:31.630 --> 01:03:33.770
There's only one thing you need to know.

01:03:33.810 --> 01:03:36.400
You know it very well, D.

01:03:36.540 --> 01:03:39.220
Once those two are united,

01:03:39.800 --> 01:03:42.910
another person like you will be born in this world.

01:03:44.150 --> 01:03:45.720
That's unforgivable.

01:03:46.140 --> 01:03:48.140
I know it very well.

01:03:48.800 --> 01:03:49.840
I know it very well!

01:05:00.220 --> 01:05:03.270
I had so much fun meeting someone as great as you.

01:05:04.840 --> 01:05:07.200
I want to hear the name of the client who hired you.

01:05:09.420 --> 01:05:12.360
A Barbarian?

01:05:12.840 --> 01:05:14.960
He's so bold.

01:05:16.230 --> 01:05:18.450
He's so bold.

01:05:20.940 --> 01:05:25.690
I can understand the situation from your letter.

01:05:26.630 --> 01:05:29.620
I remember it, too.

01:05:30.600 --> 01:05:32.960
The feeling of love is the same for both nobles and humans.

01:05:33.540 --> 01:05:36.400
I'm glad to be able to lend you my strength.

01:05:36.780 --> 01:05:38.870
I can't help it.

01:05:39.660 --> 01:05:42.540
But you must have had a hard time before you came here.

01:05:43.280 --> 01:05:45.520
Especially for the one who brought you here.

01:05:45.760 --> 01:05:49.560
But that will be rewarded in due time.

01:05:49.760 --> 01:05:58.850
This castle is for the nobles themselves.

01:06:00.090 --> 01:06:02.590
Even after thousands of years, they are still alive.

01:06:03.450 --> 01:06:08.560
That is the fear of humans, and strange rumors spread.

01:06:09.320 --> 01:06:24.870
The harbor to the stars is in my land, and it is a ship that carries you to the capital of the night at the end of the stars.

01:06:30.380 --> 01:06:35.600
Previously, the sight of ships flying from one castle to another was seen as nightfall.

01:06:36.520 --> 01:06:39.060
It was a difficult day.

01:06:39.990 --> 01:06:44.960
Since then, I haven't used this ship for a long time, so I don't know if it will be able to fly safely.

01:06:46.580 --> 01:06:52.950
I heard that the city of the night, which was flourishing, is now empty without anyone to visit.

01:06:53.290 --> 01:06:54.910
But...

01:06:54.910 --> 01:06:57.550
You are the only safe place.

01:06:59.060 --> 01:06:59.880
Somehow...

01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:01.200
It would be nice if you could fly, but...

01:07:01.200 --> 01:07:08.720
I can't keep my word.

01:07:09.260 --> 01:07:12.260
Now, I've prepared some clothes in the room.

01:07:12.900 --> 01:07:14.260
You'd better hurry up and prepare for the journey.

01:07:59.690 --> 01:07:59.910
Thank you for watching.

01:08:00.480 --> 01:08:05.820
I accept everything. Why?

01:08:06.120 --> 01:08:08.220
I don't know.

01:08:09.540 --> 01:08:10.820
What does it mean to have to live forever?

01:08:13.450 --> 01:08:16.580
I don't want you to make me suffer like a miserable person who turns a thirsty throat into a beast.

01:08:21.540 --> 01:08:24.050
That's your own choice.

01:08:26.770 --> 01:08:28.070
I committed a grave sin.

01:08:30.670 --> 01:08:34.530
The sin of taking away the lives of a large number of people who have nothing to do with it.

01:08:36.230 --> 01:08:40.020
That villagers, that's my fault.

01:08:41.180 --> 01:08:44.930
No, we just tried to pass through that village.

01:08:45.410 --> 01:08:49.980
But the villagers were too afraid of you and turned their guns away.

01:08:51.110 --> 01:08:55.450
And you, wearing a gun, did not suppress your anger and your fangs.

01:08:58.050 --> 01:08:58.910
You are no longer a noble.

01:09:00.440 --> 01:09:03.840
If I didn't love you, that wouldn't have happened.

01:09:05.270 --> 01:09:06.310
