01:09:07.200 --> 01:09:12.140
But, no matter how much you curse me, no matter how much I suffer, I don't care.

01:09:12.860 --> 01:09:14.850
You are my everything.

01:09:15.090 --> 01:09:27.120
Let's talk slowly on our journey to the stars.

01:09:32.590 --> 01:09:39.180
If I don't finish what I left here now, I won't be able to get out of here until I get back, okay?

01:10:30.252 --> 01:10:30.752
I'll be right back.

01:11:04.316 --> 01:11:04.816
Shalom.

01:11:24.924 --> 01:11:25.424
I don't.

01:11:27.004 --> 01:11:27.944
Yotskero D.

01:12:02.840 --> 01:12:04.040
Leila, don't go.

01:12:04.740 --> 01:12:07.850
Something bad is going to happen to me.

01:12:07.970 --> 01:12:08.550
